 <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-3">The 27,000mAh ceiling is why WOWOHCOOL caps standard OEM power bank capacity at 27,000mAh (99.9Wh). Any higher and the product crosses into airline-approval territory, significantly limiting retail distribution channels and increasing shipping costs by 30-50% for air freight. For OEM product planning: the 10,000-20,000mAh range (37-74Wh) is the sweet spot for frictionless global logistics.</p>
